{"nodes": [{"label": "v3 HERB evaluation harness: three arms scored two ways", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "v3/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "id": "v3_readme_harness"}, {"label": "Three arms: artifact (system under test, built natively in v3) / lucene (BM25) / vector (dense naive-RAG)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "v3/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "id": "v3_readme_three_arms"}, {"label": "Shared generator built once in the orchestrator and injected into all arms, so any difference is retrieval not the LLM", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "v3/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "id": "v3_readme_shared_generator"}, {"label": "Beyond the generator and the corpus on disk the arms share nothing: each reads, indexes and ranks with its own code", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "v3/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "id": "v3_readme_arms_share_nothing"}, {"label": "Two scorers on purpose: HERB (the anchor) + RAGAS (the multidimensional lens)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "v3/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "id": "v3_readme_two_scorers"}, {"label": "HERB scorer: per-type set-F1 (person/url/pr/company) + 0-100 content judge + abstention for unanswerables; exact, leaderboard-comparable", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "v3/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "id": "v3_readme_herb_scorer"}, {"label": "RAGAS catalog: judge-free deterministic metrics always run; SELECTED adds the judged ones (faithfulness + response relevancy, which need no reference, so RAGAS transfers to a no-gold set later)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "v3/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "id": "v3_readme_ragas_catalog"}, {"label": "Deterministic backbone is ID-based context precision/recall against gold citations (IDBasedContextPrecision / IDBasedContextRecall, no judge)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "v3/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "id": "v3_readme_idbased_context"}, {"label": "Both scorers emit raw per-question EvalResult (tidy long, nothing pre-aggregated), enabling paired tests, CIs, per-type splits and judge calibration downstream", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "v3/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "id": "v3_readme_raw_records"}, {"label": "Data split / quarantine: corpus/ oracle-stripped (pipelines see only this); raw/ holds the ~1514 questions + ground_truth + citations, read in place by evaluators; metadata directories stay on both sides", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "v3/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "id": "v3_readme_quarantine"}, {"label": "Run flow split into two phases (questions / evals / full) so iterating a scorer never re-runs the LLM; rows append as they go", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "v3/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "id": "v3_readme_two_phase_run"}, {"label": "questions phase writes an oracle-free record; evals re-joins truth (type, ground_truth, citations) by id from data/questions.jsonl", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "v3/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "id": "v3_readme_oracle_free_record"}, {"label": "Provenance: RunManifest (generation side) + EvalManifest (scoring side); no seed, no git-sha", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "v3/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "id": "v3_readme_manifests"}, {"label": "Shared generator decided: mistralai/mistral-large-3-675b-instruct-2512 on NVIDIA NIM, multilingual so HERB now and deferred Swedish Bonnier later run on the SAME generator", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "v3/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "id": "v3_readme_generator_decided"}, {"label": "lucene arm built: bm25s method=lucene (k1=0.9/b=0.4 BEIR values), one document per artifact, artifacts-only index (all 17,087 gold citations resolve to an artifact id)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "v3/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "id": "v3_readme_lucene_built"}, {"label": "vector arm built: nvidia/llama-nemotron-embed-1b-v2 on NIM (8192-token ctx, no truncation/chunking), exact brute-force cosine; a capable multilingual dense baseline, not the all-MiniLM textbook default", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "v3/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "id": "v3_readme_vector_built"}, {"label": "Question ids minted deterministically (HERB ships none): <product>::a|u::<index>, 815 answerable + 699 unanswerable = 1514 unique, the paired-test join key; exact id filter raises on miss", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "v3/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "id": "v3_readme_question_ids"}, {"label": "gold-100: a balanced answerable subset by seeded round-robin over HERB types (equal allocation ~20/type), so report per-type and don't compare its aggregate to HERB's published average", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "v3/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "id": "v3_readme_gold100"}, {"label": "Still open: RAGAS computation (library vs hand-built), orchestrator split into questions/evals/full, generation contract, judge model (re-run baselines if not GPT-4o), top-k, which set to run, judge calibration size", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "v3/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "id": "v3_readme_open_decisions"}, {"label": "Caveat: answer-level scoring measures the whole pipeline, so a strong generator can mask retrieval quality; deterministic context precision/recall keeps an endpoint pointed at retrieval", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "v3/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "id": "v3_readme_generator_masks_caveat"}], "edges": [{"relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "source_file": "v3/README.md", "source": "v3_readme_three_arms", "target": "v3_readme_harness"}, {"relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "source_file": "v3/README.md", "source": "v3_readme_two_scorers", "target": "v3_readme_harness"}, {"relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "source_file": "v3/README.md", "source": "v3_readme_shared_generator", "target": "v3_readme_three_arms"}, {"relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "source_file": "v3/README.md", "source": "v3_readme_arms_share_nothing", "target": "v3_readme_three_arms"}, {"relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "source_file": "v3/README.md", "source": "v3_readme_herb_scorer", "target": "v3_readme_two_scorers"}, {"relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence"